#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:221
msgid "This field\\'s type needs a Plus plan or higher, so it does not show on your checkout. Upgrade to restore it, or delete the field."
msgstr "Tento typ poľa vyžaduje plán Plus alebo vyšší, takže sa vo vašom pokladničnom procese nezobrazuje. Ak ho chcete obnoviť, prejdite na vyšší plán alebo pole odstráňte."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:225
msgid "Badge collections need a Plus plan or higher, so this one does not show on your checkout. Upgrade to restore it, or delete it."
msgstr "Zbierky odznakov vyžadujú plán Plus alebo vyšší, takže sa táto v pokladničnom procese nezobrazuje. Ak ju chcete obnoviť, prejdite na vyšší plán alebo ju odstráňte."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:228
msgid "This order bump has an A/B test associated with it and cannot be moved or removed. Delete the test to unlock it."
msgstr "Tento doplnok objednávky má priradený A/B test a nemožno ho presunúť ani odstrániť. Odstráňte test, aby ste ho odomkli."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:231
msgid "This bump is placed here automatically by its Checkout and Side Cart display location. It also appears in the side cart and isn\\'t counted toward this slot\\'s order bump limit."
msgstr "Tento bump je tu umiestnený automaticky podľa jeho zobrazovacej pozície v pokladni a bočnom košíku. Tiež sa zobrazuje v bočnom košíku a nezapočítava sa do limitu order bumpov tohto slotu."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:234
msgid "The offer product for this bump no longer exists, so the bump will not display. Choose a new offer product."
msgstr "Ponúkaný produkt pre tento bump už neexistuje, takže sa bump nezobrazí. Vyberte nový ponúkaný produkt."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:237
msgid "The offer product for this bump is not published, so the bump appears for you but never for customers."
msgstr "Ponúkaný produkt pre tento bump nie je publikovaný, takže sa bump zobrazuje vám, ale zákazníkom nikdy."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:240
msgid "The offer product for this bump has no price, so the bump will not display."
msgstr "Ponúkaný produkt pre tento bump nemá cenu, takže sa bump nezobrazí."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:243
msgid "The offer product for this bump is out of stock, so the bump will not display until it is back in stock."
msgstr "Ponúkaný produkt pre tento bump nie je na sklade, takže sa bump nezobrazí, kým nebude opäť na sklade."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:246
msgid "The product this bump replaces in the cart no longer exists, so the bump will not display."
msgstr "Produkt, ktorý tento bump v košíku nahrádza, už neexistuje, takže sa bump nezobrazí."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:249
msgid "This bump replaces a product in the cart, so it only appears once that product has been added."
msgstr "Tento bump nahrádza produkt v košíku, takže sa zobrazí až po pridaní tohto produktu."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:252
msgid "This item has display conditions. It will only appear to customers who meet the configured criteria and may not be visible on every checkout."
msgstr "Táto položka má podmienky zobrazenia. Zobrazí sa iba zákazníkom, ktorí spĺňajú nastavené kritériá, a nemusí byť viditeľná pri každej pokladni."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:255
msgid "The offer product for this bump is hidden from the shop catalog, so this bump is the only place customers will see it."
msgstr "Ponúkaný produkt pre tento bump je skrytý v katalógu obchodu, takže toto je jediné miesto, kde ho zákazníci uvidia."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:258
msgid "The offer product for this bump is already in the preview cart, so it may not be visible in the preview."
msgstr "Ponukový produkt pre tento bump je už v náhľadovom košíku, takže nemusí byť viditeľný v náhľade."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:268
msgid "Drag to reorder"
msgstr "Pretiahnite pre zmenu poradia"

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/slots/AssignedItem.tsx:350
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Odstrániť"

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:122
msgid "Google Address Autocomplete"
msgstr "Automatické dopĺňanie adries Google"

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:123
msgid "Fetchify Address Autocomplete"
msgstr "Automatické dopĺňanie adries Fetchify"

# 1: first address autocomplete provider name, 2: second address autocomplete provider name.
#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:128
msgid "%1$s and %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s a %2$s"

# %s: name of the enabled address autocomplete provider(s).
#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:136
msgid "Separate Address Fields is incompatible with %s."
msgstr "Samostatné adresné polia nie sú kompatibilné s %s."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:150
msgid "Step"
msgstr "Krok"

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:167
msgid "This information covers custom fields added to checkout editor slots. Fields added by custom code or another plugin may behave differently."
msgstr "Tieto informácie sa vzťahujú na vlastné polia pridané do slotov editora pokladne. Polia pridané vlastným kódom alebo iným pluginom sa môžu správať inak."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:174
msgid "Express checkout comes before your fields."
msgstr "Expresná pokladňa má prednosť pred vašimi poliami."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:175
msgid "The express buttons sit at the top of checkout. A customer can tap one before they have seen your custom fields, let alone filled them in."
msgstr "Expresné tlačidlá sú umiestnené v hornej časti pokladne. Zákazník môže ťuknúť na jedno z nich ešte skôr, než uvidí vaše vlastné polia, nieto ich vyplní."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:178
msgid "Left on, express checkout stays available."
msgstr "Keď zostane zapnutá, expresná pokladňa zostáva k dispozícii."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:179
msgid "Customers can pay with it even when a required field applies. What happens next is up to the gateway: some run the full checkout validation and return an error, others place the order without the fields."
msgstr "Zákazníci s ňou môžu zaplatiť aj vtedy, keď sa uplatňuje povinné pole. Čo sa stane ďalej, závisí od platobnej brány: niektoré vykonajú úplnú kontrolu pokladne a vrátia chybu, iné vytvoria objednávku bez polí."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:182
msgid "Whatever they filled in is still saved."
msgstr "Čokoľvek vyplnili, sa stále uloží."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:183
msgid "Answers given before tapping express are written to the order, and any fee they add is charged. Skipped fields are left empty and add no fee."
msgstr "Odpovede zadané pred ťuknutím na expresnú možnosť sa zapíšu do objednávky a akýkoľvek poplatok, ktorý pridajú, sa účtuje. Preskočené polia zostanú prázdne a nepridajú žiadny poplatok."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:186
msgid "Turned off, the buttons are hidden instead."
msgstr "Po vypnutí sa namiesto toho tlačidlá skryjú."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:187
msgid "Express checkout is taken off checkout whenever a required custom field applies to the cart, so the field cannot be skipped. Express buttons elsewhere on your store are unaffected."
msgstr "Expresné dokončenie objednávky sa odoberie z pokladne vždy, keď sa na košík vzťahuje povinné vlastné pole, takže pole nemožno preskočiť. Expresné tlačidlá inde vo vašom obchode tým nie sú dotknuté."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:190
msgid "Display conditions still count."
msgstr "Podmienky zobrazenia sa stále započítavajú."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:191
msgid "A required field shown to only some carts withholds express checkout from only those carts."
msgstr "Povinné pole zobrazené len niektorým košíkom zablokuje expresné dokončenie objednávky len týmto košíkom."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:194
msgid "Which to choose."
msgstr "Ktorú možnosť zvoliť."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:195
msgid "Leave it on if you would rather take an incomplete order than lose the sale. Turn it off when you cannot fulfill the order without the answer - a delivery date, an engraving, or a consent checkbox."
msgstr "Nechajte ho zapnuté, ak radšej prijmete neúplnú objednávku, než by ste prišli o predaj. Vypnite ho, keď objednávku nemôžete vybaviť bez odpovede - dátumu doručenia, gravírovania alebo zaškrtávacieho políčka súhlasu."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:203
msgid "Shipping fields aren\\'t listed here."
msgstr "Polia dopravy tu nie sú uvedené."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:204
msgid "WooCommerce decides which shipping fields appear based on the customer\\'s country."
msgstr "WooCommerce určuje, ktoré polia dopravy sa zobrazia, podľa krajiny zákazníka."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:207
msgid "Fields are removed, not hidden."
msgstr "Polia sa odstraňujú, nie skrývajú."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:208
msgid "A field turned off here is taken out of checkout entirely. It isn\\'t shown, it isn\\'t validated, and it isn\\'t saved to the order - even when the customer\\'s country normally requires it."
msgstr "Pole vypnuté tu sa úplne odstráni z pokladne. Nezobrazí sa, neoveruje sa a neuloží sa do objednávky - dokonca ani vtedy, keď ho krajina zákazníka zvyčajne vyžaduje."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:211
msgid "When billing and shipping are the same."
msgstr "Keď sú fakturačná a dodacia adresa rovnaké."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:212
msgid "The shipping value is still collected and saved, but the matching billing field on the order is left empty. Turn off Last Name and the order has a shipping last name and a blank billing last name."
msgstr "Dodacia hodnota sa stále zhromaždí a uloží, ale zodpovedajúce fakturačné pole v objednávke zostane prázdne. Vypnite Priezvisko a objednávka bude mať dodacie priezvisko a prázdne fakturačné priezvisko."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:215
msgid "On orders with no shipping."
msgstr "Pri objednávkach bez dopravy."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:216
msgid "Billing is the only address, so a removed field isn\\'t recorded on the order at all."
msgstr "Fakturácia je jediná adresa, takže odstránené pole sa do objednávky vôbec nezaznamená."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:219
msgid "Take care with Address 1, Country and Postcode."
msgstr "Dávajte si pozor na Adresa 1, Krajina a PSČ."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:220
msgid "Payment gateways use these to verify the cardholder\\'s address, and Country sets the tax location on orders that aren\\'t shipped. Removing them can cause declined payments or incorrect tax."
msgstr "Platobné brány ich používajú na overenie adresy držiteľa karty a Krajina určuje daňovú lokalitu pri objednávkach, ktoré sa nezasielajú. Ich odstránenie môže spôsobiť zamietnuté platby alebo nesprávnu daň."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:227
msgid "Payment gateways use this to verify the cardholder\\'s address. Removing it can cause declined payments."
msgstr "Platobné brány to používajú na overenie adresy držiteľa karty. Jeho odstránenie môže spôsobiť zamietnuté platby."

#: client/ts/admin/Components/CheckoutEditor/panels/EditorSettingsPanel.tsx:232
msgid "WooCommerce is set to require this field. Removing it here leaves the billing copy empty, and collects nothing at all on orders with no shipping address."
